[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11220.63, "timestamp": "03:07:00", "text": "好吧，我想我……哦，等等。好的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11223.75, "timestamp": "03:07:03", "text": "我得去。是的。你做了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11227.349, "timestamp": "03:07:07", "text": "说？应用程序音频捕获测试版。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11229.11, "timestamp": "03:07:09", "text": "好的，他能听见。我只是增加了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11231.349, "timestamp": "03:07:11", "text": "桌面音频居然能用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11233.83, "timestamp": "03:07:13", "text": "总之，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11236.87, "timestamp": "03:07:16", "text": "是啊，谢谢前辈。总之，嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11240.23, "timestamp": "03:07:20", "text": "呃，关于那些事。不，只有两个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11242.07, "timestamp": "03:07:22", "text": "我们中的一些人。没有，只有两个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11243.51, "timestamp": "03:07:23", "text": "我们正在交谈。你听到三个了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11246.389, "timestamp": "03:07:26", "text": "人们？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11249.11, "timestamp": "03:07:29", "text": "哦，你正在用你的手机看直播呢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11251.83, "timestamp": "03:07:31", "text": "是直播吗？或者像，或者你可能有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11253.99, "timestamp": "03:07:33", "text": "停止音频播放。所以，浏览器音频是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11257.03, "timestamp": "03:07:37", "text": "显示音频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11261.51, "timestamp": "03:07:41", "text": "嗯，我想我在开始给予之前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11262.87, "timestamp": "03:07:42", "text": "给其他人的建议，我需要弄清楚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11266.07, "timestamp": "03:07:46", "text": "把我的东西拿出来。没事的。拿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11269.03, "timestamp": "03:07:49", "text": "你的时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11270.87, "timestamp": "03:07:50", "text": "我会帮你处理那些显而易见的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11273.03, "timestamp": "03:07:53", "text": "如果你需要任何帮助，我随时乐意效劳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11274.55, "timestamp": "03:07:54", "text": "帮帮你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 